      "description": [
        {
          "text": "<p>This entry represents the nuclear protein ABT1 and its homologous counterpart, pre-rRNA-processing protein Esf2 (eighteen S factor 2), from yeast.</p>\n\n<p>ABT1 associates with the TATA-binding protein (TBP) and enhances basal transcription activity of class II promoters. Meanwhile, ABT1 could be a transcription cofactor that can bind to DNA in a sequence-independent manner [[cite:PUB00083327]].</p>",
